==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 4.33~8 seconds<sup>130f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 4.33~8 seconds<sup>130f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 4.33~8 seconds<sup>130f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As there is no boss shockwave, this stage can be rushed since the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] that spawn simply burrow away, allowing you to freely damage the enemy base. Upgrade your Worker Cat as high as you can before the Zoges and Znaches reach your base, and then spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]]. Be sure to protect your base as well by spamming Wall Cats.

